[DESCRIPTION]: Converts seconds to 'hh:mm:ss' format<sep>[DEMO]: mysql> SELECT SEC_TO_TIME(2378);
-> '00:39:38'
mysql> SELECT SEC_TO_TIME(2378) + 0;
